OL,3,GNEWSATwo jailed for attacking man with
OL,4,Amachete and knife in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed after
OL,7,Fattacking a man with a machete and a
OL,8,Fknife in Glasgow.
OL,10,FAt the High Court in Edinburgh, Michael
OL,11,FFrati, 32, was jailed for five years
OL,12,Fand four months, and Paul Connor, 49,
OL,13,Fwas jailed for six years for the attack
OL,14,Fin Shettleston on 13 March, 2024.
OL,16,FThe victim, Gerald Brennan, suffered
OL,17,Fmultiple facial and head wounds, skull
OL,18,Fand facial bone fractures, stab wounds
OL,19,Fto his chest and back, a collapsed lung
OL,20,Fand extensive wounds to his hands and
OL,21,Fwrists.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
