OL,3,GNEWSATwo jailed for attacking man with
OL,4,Amachete and knife in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Ghosh told the court: "There is no
OL,7,Fevidence you tried to help the
OL,8,Fcomplainer or that you called for help
OL,9,F- he had suffered severe blood loss and
OL,10,Finjuries which were life threatening."
